{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_08_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_08","title":"亲族","storyCode":"SV-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"6b0f5b69a94328a7070bbf9e05fdc65eef7cf1c288aed286b97a08faebbd7d04","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"歌蕾蒂娅杀死了海嗣。主教愤怒地扑向深海猎人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣的身体再一次被歌蕾蒂娅洞穿。\n海嗣将死。\n海嗣没有把“脸”转向主教。旁人也不可能知道海嗣是否长着眼睛，但斯卡蒂就是能感觉到怪物的视线——至少她自己这么觉得。\n它正“看着”主教。\n无形的洋流正冲刷着主教，袍裙沉重地压在他的身上，几要把他摧垮。\n但海嗣正对她们说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是更像我......还是更像他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Gla-dia。 你很强壮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅冰冷地注视着猎物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"情绪。会有我们血亲学习的。我们也在传达许多，我们会试着传达给你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。活着吧。活着会很好。下一次会有其他血亲找到你......向你询问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不太会问问题。我们会学会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"慢慢地，海嗣低哼着蹲下去。\n怪物的躯体不再起伏。它蜷缩起来，像一朵迅速枯败的花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂如释重负。\n不，不能这么说。她并没有从真相中恢复过来。但这个猎物的死让她感受到......\n它到底也只是个生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些孽种。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教提高了音量。零碎的声响在他的喉头，在激烈战斗留下的碎屑中爬行，像是他的声带正不住嘟囔。\n歌蕾蒂娅甚至没去看他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，上前来。现在轮到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只垃圾孑然一身。外面那些恐鱼也不是它这族的。那么，只会是你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我来把你们撕碎。我来让你们亵渎的行径受罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己来。是得在这里把你们这些杂种都解决掉。生命可贵，但留你们的命是浪费资源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"一个重伤的孽种。一个动弹不得的孽种。我会把你们的残渣抛洒在大地上，让最低贱的陆地生物吃掉你们的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"杀死你们两个，轻而易举——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用再装了。比起海嗣这些垃圾，还是你们这种曾经是人，现在又伪装成人的最让人反胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会死在这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是把我忘了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂翻了个白眼。歌蕾蒂娅笑了笑。\n主教迟疑了一下，转过头去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
